<doc id="23084" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23084" title="Vanuatu">
Vanuatu

&lt;a href="Sistim%20koordinat%20g%C3%A9ografis"&gt;Koordinat&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;a href="http%3A//kvaleberg.com/extensions/mapsources/index.php%3Fparams%3D17_45_S_168_18_E_"&gt;17°45′S 168°18′E&lt;/a&gt;
Vanuatu (&lt;a href="International%20Phonetic%20Alphabet"&gt;IPA&lt;/a&gt;: [ˌvɑːnuˈɑːtu]), ngaran resmina Républik Vanuatu, mangrupa &lt;a href="nagara%20pulo"&gt;nagara pulo&lt;/a&gt; nu aya di &lt;a href="Samudra%20Pasifik"&gt;Samudra Pasifik&lt;/a&gt; kidul. &lt;a href="Kapuloan"&gt;Kapuloan&lt;/a&gt; ieu perenahna 1,750 &lt;a href="kilom%C3%A9ter"&gt;km&lt;/a&gt; (1090 &lt;a href="mil"&gt;mil&lt;/a&gt;) di wétaneun &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt; béh kalér, 500&amp;nbsp;km (310 mil) wétan kaléreun &lt;a href="Kal%C3%A9donia%20Anyar"&gt;Kalédonia Anyar&lt;/a&gt;, kuloneun &lt;a href="Fiji"&gt;Fiji&lt;/a&gt; jeung kiduleun &lt;a href="Kapuloan%20Solomon"&gt;Kapuloan Solomon&lt;/a&gt;.
Vanuatu baheulana munggaran dicicingan ku urang &lt;a href="M%C3%A9lan%C3%A9sia"&gt;Mélanésia&lt;/a&gt;. Urang &lt;a href="%C3%89ropa"&gt;Éropa&lt;/a&gt; mimiti nyicingan wewengkon ieu ahir &lt;a href="abad%20ka-18"&gt;abad ka-18&lt;/a&gt; nu juntrungannana dina taun &lt;a href="1906"&gt;1906&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="United%20Kingdom"&gt;Britania&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Perancis"&gt;Perancis&lt;/a&gt; sacara resmi ngaku &lt;a href="nagara"&gt;nagara&lt;/a&gt; ieu, nu sacara babarengan diatur minangka &lt;a href="H%C3%A9bride%20Anyar"&gt;Hébride Anyar&lt;/a&gt; ngaliwatan &lt;a href="Kondominium%20%28hukum%29"&gt;kondominium&lt;/a&gt; Briania-Perancis. Gerakan kamerdikaan mucunghul taun &lt;a href="1970-an"&gt;1970-an&lt;/a&gt;, nu ahirna Républik Vanuatu ngadeg taun &lt;a href="1980"&gt;1980&lt;/a&gt;.
